{"UpdateTime": "2026-10-23T14:58:04+08:00", "UpdateInterval": 60, "SrcUpdateTime": "2026-10-23T14:58:04+08:00", "SrcUpdateInterval": 300, "AuthorityCode": "KRTC", "Alerts": [{"AlertID": "mrt_302", "Title": "高雄捷運因應10/23高雄市停班停課之列車行駛概況", "Description": "依據中央氣象署預報資料顯示，受薔琵颱風影響，故高雄市政府宣布10月23日（星期五）停班停課。\n\n高雄捷運10月23日（星期五）14：30 起紅橘全線列車班距為10分鐘，深夜時段班距為20分鐘，並視狀況調整班距，洽詢電話07-7938888。\n", "Status": 1, "Scope": {"Network": {}, "Stations": [], "Lines": [], "Routes": [], "Trains": [], "LineSections": []}, "AlertURL": "https://www.krtc.com.tw/Information/notice_more?id=6a89481664cc4e71822385bb8441035d", "StartTime": "2026-10-22T00:00:00+08:00", "EndTime": "2026-10-23T23:59:00+08:00", "PublishTime": "2026-10-22T00:00:00+08:00", "UpdateTime": "2026-10-23T14:14:11+08:00"}]}